# Pairs with AllocatorNeverReissues. A recovering shard resumes its allocator
# from the trim floor instead of past the highest stored offset, so it hands out
# offsets that acknowledged writes already hold.
MODULE: AllocatorNeverReissuesRecoveryFromTail
TARGET: AllocatorNeverReissues
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the allocator recovers from the tail and reissues acknowledged offsets
PERTURBS: ShardCrash

--- FIND
    /\ next' = Max({tail} \cup {o + 1 : o \in durable})
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: recovered from the floor, not the high-water mark.
    /\ next' = tail
--- END